        "summary": "<xdoc><p>Gets the job data workspace as an enterprise geodatabase connection file. This tool is typically used in ModelBuilder to retrieve the connection file for use as an input to other tools such as Reconcile Versions in the model.</p><note type=\"legacy\"/><p group=\"note\">This is a deprecated tool. It is recommended that current Workflow Manager (Classic) users begin new projects using the services-driven ArcGIS Workflow Manager for ArcGIS Pro.</p></xdoc>",
